                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 167/81.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Minister Rockhill</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,<date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1907-01-15"><hi rendition="#italic">January 15,
                        1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Root states that the settlement of the Lienchou indemnity by an exchange of
                    notes is approved.)</p>
            </div>
